@startuml target_frontend_components
' Source baseline: pi-mono-java dfb90cac4e233e09a0b8f047f7e9f4682f5ad238. Thinking-only evidence: 4cc8dd86 frontend/src/components/ThinkingDisclosure.vue template; target displays original model reasoning.
' Source evidence: frontend/src/App.vue submit; frontend/src/composables/useRuntimeApi.ts loadHistory, requestRaw.
' Source evidence: frontend/src/projectors/runtimeEventProjector.ts projectRuntimeEvents; frontend/src/types/product.ts.
' Observed behavior: current app directly owns Runtime state and legacy controls; no public Chat Gateway.
' Target-only architecture: every class and relationship below is a product integration target.
' Design reason: isolate protocol and host identity, use per-Chat state, and make recovery read-only.
title Global product frontend components - all target-only
top to bottom direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
package "Browser views" {
  class ChatWorkspace <<view>>
  class ContentViews <<view>> {
    safe Markdown for Assistant
    plain text for tool and thinking
  }
}
package "Per-Chat application" {
  class ConversationCoordinator <<per-Chat>>
  class HistoryRecovery <<per-Chat>>
  class ConfigurationCoordinator <<per-Chat>>
}
package "Per-Chat state and projection" {
  class ChatStore <<per-Chat>>
  class DraftStore <<per-Chat>>
  class ToolConfirmationStore <<per-Chat>>
  class ConfigurationStore <<per-Chat>>
  class PublicEventReducer <<pure>>
}
package "Transport boundary" {
  interface PublicChatGateway {
    submit(frozenIntent)
    subscribe(onEvent)
    readHistory(page)
  }
  class MateChatAdapter <<per-Chat>>
  class MockChatAdapter <<prototype>>
  class HostTransport <<host-owned>>
}
package "External server boundary" {
  class MatePublicAPI <<target server>>
  class AuthorizedChatMapping <<target server>>
  class RuntimeAdapter <<target server>>
  class RuntimeSessionAPI <<external contract>>
}
ChatWorkspace --> ConversationCoordinator : user intents
ChatWorkspace --> ConfigurationCoordinator : top bar / Slash
ChatWorkspace --> ContentViews : read-only snapshot
ConversationCoordinator *-- "1" DraftStore
ConversationCoordinator *-- "1" ToolConfirmationStore
ConversationCoordinator *-- "1" ChatStore
ConversationCoordinator --> PublicChatGateway : submit / subscribe
ConversationCoordinator --> HistoryRecovery : reconcile only
HistoryRecovery --> PublicChatGateway : read-only methods
HistoryRecovery --> PublicEventReducer : history
ConversationCoordinator --> PublicEventReducer : receipt / live
PublicEventReducer --> ChatStore : atomic reduced snapshot
PublicEventReducer --> ToolConfirmationStore : pending decision state
ContentViews --> ChatStore : immutable view
ConfigurationCoordinator *-- "1" ConfigurationStore
ConfigurationCoordinator --> HostTransport : gated config operation
MateChatAdapter ..|> PublicChatGateway
MockChatAdapter ..|> PublicChatGateway
MateChatAdapter --> HostTransport
HostTransport --> MatePublicAPI : public Chat protocol
MatePublicAPI --> AuthorizedChatMapping : authorize and resolve
AuthorizedChatMapping --> RuntimeAdapter
RuntimeAdapter --> RuntimeSessionAPI : internal protocol
note bottom of PublicChatGateway
Adapters selected explicitly; no Runtime fallback.
Freeze request intent, not mutable authority.
Server rechecks state for every mutation.
end note
note bottom of ChatStore
Generation rejects old-Chat responses.
Completed events and preview are separate.
No credentials or internal Session IDs.
end note
